---
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-base py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1
          class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content md:text-5xl"
        >
          Terms of Service.
        </h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-brand uppercase">
          Last Updated: October 15, 2025
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
        <section>
          <h2
            class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content"
          >
            1. The Symeno Model & Agreement
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            By accessing or using the Symeno LLC ("Symeno", "we", "us") website,
            you agree to be bound by these Terms. Symeno operates a high-volume
            retail arbitrage model. We source authentic goods from authorized
            distributors globally to offer compressed margins to the end
            consumer. We do not manufacture these products.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content"
          >
            2. Pricing & Algorithmic Errors
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Our pricing is dynamically updated based on global wholesale data.
            While we strive for absolute accuracy, our algorithms are managed by
            humans, and errors can occur. If a product is listed at an incorrect
            price due to a typographical or systematic error, we reserve the
            right to refuse or cancel any orders placed for that product,
            regardless of whether the order has been confirmed and your credit
            card charged. If your card has been charged, a full refund will be
            issued immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content"
          >
            3. Intellectual Property & Authenticity
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            All products sold on Symeno are 100% authentic and acquired through
            legally verified supply chains. However, all brand names, logos, and
            trademarks (e.g., Apple, Sony, Dyson) are the property of their
            respective owners. Symeno makes no claim of ownership over these
            third-party trademarks and uses them solely under the doctrine of
            nominal fair use to identify the products being sold.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content"
          >
            4. Fraud Prevention & Order Limits
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            To maintain our pricing model and prevent unauthorized reselling of
            our inventory, Symeno reserves the right to limit the quantity of
            items purchased per person, per household, or per order. We actively
            monitor for fraudulent activity using strict heuristic models. Any
            order flagged by our security perimeter will be automatically
            canceled without notice.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>
